{"text":"kuruntokai","n":21,"lines":["வண்டுபடத் ததைந்த கொடியிணர் இடையிடுபு","பொன்செய் புனையிழை கட்டிய மகளிர்","கதுப்பிற் றோன்றும் புதுப்பூங் கொன்றை","கானங் காரெனக் கூறினும்","யானோ தேரேன் அவர் பொய்வழங் கலரே"],"tr":["vaṇṭupaṭat tatainta koṭiyiṇar iṭaiyiṭupu","poṉcey puṉaiyiḻai kaṭṭiya makaḷir","katuppiṟ ṟōṉṟum putuppūṅ koṉṟai","kāṉaṅ kāreṉak kūṟiṉum","yāṉō tērēṉ avar poyvaḻaṅ kalarē"],"colophon":{"tinai":"mullai","tinai_ta":"முல்லை","speaker_ta":"தலைவி கூற்று","poet_ta":"ஓதலாந்தையார்","speaker_en":"the heroine (talaivi)","poet_tr":"Ōtalāntaiyār"},"scan":{"meter":"āciriyappā","ok":true,"checks":[{"name":"lines","ok":true,"detail":"5 lines"},{"name":"feet per line","ok":true,"detail":"1×5, 3×4, 1×3 feet"},{"name":"foot types","ok":true,"detail":"iyaṟcīr 17, veṇcīr 2, other 1"},{"name":"linkage","ok":true,"detail":"veṇṭaḷai 9, āciriyattaḷai 8, kalittaḷai 1, ? 1"},{"name":"ending","ok":true,"detail":"ends on ஏ"},{"name":"long lines","ok":true,"detail":"1 five-foot line (neṭilaṭi)"}],"ending":"ஏ","lines":[[{"text":"வண்டுபடத்","tr":"vaṇṭupaṭat","foot":"kūviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"வண்","tr":"vaṇ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"டுப","tr":"ṭupa"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"டத்","tr":"ṭat"}]},{"text":"ததைந்த","tr":"tatainta","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"ததைந்","tr":"tatain"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"த","tr":"ta"}]},{"text":"கொடியிணர்","tr":"koṭiyiṇar","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கொடி","tr":"koṭi"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யிணர்","tr":"yiṇar"}]},{"text":"இடையிடுபு","tr":"iṭaiyiṭupu","foot":"karuviḷaṅkāy","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"இடை","tr":"iṭai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யிடு","tr":"yiṭu"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பு","tr":"pu"}]}],[{"text":"பொன்செய்","tr":"poṉcey","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பொன்","tr":"poṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"செய்","tr":"cey"}]},{"text":"புனையிழை","tr":"puṉaiyiḻai","foot":"karuviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"புனை","tr":"puṉai"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"யிழை","tr":"yiḻai"}]},{"text":"கட்டிய","tr":"kaṭṭiya","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கட்","tr":"kaṭ"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"டிய","tr":"ṭiya"}]},{"text":"மகளிர்","tr":"makaḷir","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"மக","tr":"maka"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ளிர்","tr":"ḷir"}]}],[{"text":"கதுப்பிற்","tr":"katuppiṟ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கதுப்","tr":"katup"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பிற்","tr":"piṟ"}]},{"text":"றோன்றும்","tr":"ṟōṉṟum","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"றோன்","tr":"ṟōṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றும்","tr":"ṟum"}]},{"text":"புதுப்பூங்","tr":"putuppūṅ","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"புதுப்","tr":"putup"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"பூங்","tr":"pūṅ"}]},{"text":"கொன்றை","tr":"koṉṟai","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கொன்","tr":"koṉ"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"றை","tr":"ṟai"}]}],[{"text":"கானங்","tr":"kāṉaṅ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னங்","tr":"ṉaṅ"}]},{"text":"காரெனக்","tr":"kāreṉak","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கா","tr":"kā"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"ரெனக்","tr":"reṉak"}]},{"text":"கூறினும்","tr":"kūṟiṉum","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"கூ","tr":"kū"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"றினும்","tr":"ṟiṉum"}]}],[{"text":"யானோ","tr":"yāṉō","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"யா","tr":"yā"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"னோ","tr":"ṉō"}]},{"text":"தேரேன்","tr":"tērēṉ","foot":"tēmā","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"தே","tr":"tē"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரேன்","tr":"rēṉ"}]},{"text":"அவர்","tr":"avar","foot":"malar","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"அவர்","tr":"avar"}]},{"text":"பொய்வழங்","tr":"poyvaḻaṅ","foot":"kūviḷam","acai":[{"kind":"nēr","text":"பொய்","tr":"poy"},{"kind":"nirai","text":"வழங்","tr":"vaḻaṅ"}]},{"text":"கலரே","tr":"kalarē","foot":"puḷimā","acai":[{"kind":"nirai","text":"கல","tr":"kala"},{"kind":"nēr","text":"ரே","tr":"rē"}]}]]},"ai":{"lines":[{"words":[{"surface":"வண்டுபட","parts":[{"text":"வண்டு","lemma":"வண்டு","gloss":"bee"},{"text":"பட","lemma":"படு","gloss":"to occur/swarm"}],"gloss":"as bees swarm"},{"surface":"ததைந்த","parts":[{"text":"ததைந்த","lemma":"ததை","gloss":"densely blossomed"}],"gloss":"densely blossomed"},{"surface":"கொடியிணர்","parts":[{"text":"கொடி","lemma":"கொடி","gloss":"creeper/branch"},{"text":"இணர்","lemma":"இணர்","gloss":"cluster"}],"gloss":"clusters on the branches"},{"surface":"இடையிடுபு","parts":[{"text":"இடை","lemma":"இடை","gloss":"interval"},{"text":"இடுபு","lemma":"இடு","gloss":"placing/appearing"}],"gloss":"appearing at intervals"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"பொன்செய்","parts":[{"text":"பொன்","lemma":"பொன்","gloss":"gold"},{"text":"செய்","lemma":"செய்","gloss":"made"}],"gloss":"made of gold"},{"surface":"புனையிழை","parts":[{"text":"புனை","lemma":"புனை","gloss":"crafted/adorned"},{"text":"இழை","lemma":"இழை","gloss":"jewel"}],"gloss":"crafted jewels"},{"surface":"கட்டிய","parts":[{"text":"கட்டிய","lemma":"கட்டு","gloss":"worn/tied"}],"gloss":"worn"},{"surface":"மகளிர்","parts":[{"text":"மகளிர்","lemma":"மகளிர்","gloss":"women"}],"gloss":"women"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கதுப்பில்","parts":[{"text":"கதுப்பு","lemma":"கதுப்பு","gloss":"hair"},{"text":"இல்","lemma":"இல்","gloss":"locative suffix"}],"gloss":"like the hair"},{"surface":"தோன்றும்","parts":[{"text":"தோன்று","lemma":"தோன்று","gloss":"appear"},{"text":"உம்","lemma":"உம்","gloss":"relative participle suffix"}],"gloss":"appearing"},{"surface":"புது","parts":[{"text":"புது","lemma":"புது","gloss":"new"}],"gloss":"fresh"},{"surface":"பூம்","parts":[{"text":"பூம்","lemma":"பூம்","gloss":"flowery"}],"gloss":"flowery","split_unverified":true},{"surface":"கொன்றை","parts":[{"text":"கொன்றை","lemma":"கொன்றை","gloss":"Cassia tree"}],"gloss":"Cassia"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"கானம்","parts":[{"text":"கானம்","lemma":"கானம்","gloss":"forest"}],"gloss":"the forest"},{"surface":"காரென","parts":[{"text":"கார்","lemma":"கார்","gloss":"rainy season"},{"text":"என","lemma":"என","gloss":"as/that"}],"gloss":"as the rainy season"},{"surface":"கூறினும்","parts":[{"text":"கூறு","lemma":"கூறு","gloss":"say"},{"text":"இனும்","lemma":"இனும்","gloss":"even if"}],"gloss":"even if it says"}]},{"words":[{"surface":"யானோ","parts":[{"text":"யான்","lemma":"யான்","gloss":"I"},{"text":"ஓ","lemma":"ஓ","gloss":"clitic of emphasis"}],"gloss":"As for me"},{"surface":"தேரேன்","parts":[{"text":"தேரேன்","lemma":"தேர்","gloss":"I will not believe"}],"gloss":"I do not believe"},{"surface":"அவர்","parts":[{"text":"அவர்","lemma":"அவர்","gloss":"he"}],"gloss":"he"},{"surface":"பொய்வழங்கலரே","parts":[{"text":"பொய்","lemma":"பொய்","gloss":"lie"},{"text":"வழங்கலர்","lemma":"வழங்கு","gloss":"one who practices/utters"},{"text":"ஏ","lemma":"ஏ","gloss":"indeed"}],"gloss":"is indeed not one who speaks lies"}]}],"literal":"As bees swarm, densely blossomed clusters on the branches appearing at intervals, / like crafted jewels made of gold worn by women / appearing in their hair, the fresh flowers of the Konrai, / even if the forest says it is the rainy season, / as for me, I do not believe it; he is not one who speaks lies.","translation":"The fresh blossoms of the konrai tree, appearing at intervals in dense clusters where bees swarm, look like the crafted golden jewels worn by women in their dark hair. Even if the forest declares that the rainy season has arrived, I will not believe it; for my lover would never utter a falsehood.","modern":"வண்டுகள் மொய்க்குமாறு நெருங்கி மலர்ந்த கிளைகளின் பூங்கொத்துகள் இடைவெளிவிட்டுத் தோன்றுவது, பொன்னால் செய்த அணிகலன்களை அணிந்த பெண்களின் கூந்தலில் விளங்குவது போலத் தோன்றும். புதிய மலர்களைக் கொண்ட கொன்றை மரங்கள் நிறைந்த இக்காடு 'கார்காலம் வந்துவிட்டது' என்று கூறினாலும், நான் அதனை நம்பமாட்டேன். ஏனெனில், என் தலைவர் பொய் சொல்பவர் அல்லர்.","explanation":"This poem belongs to the Mullai (forest) landscape, which is associated with the theme of patient waiting during the rainy season. The heroine's lover had promised to return before the onset of the rains. Now, the Konrai (cassia) trees have burst into golden blossoms, which traditionally signals the arrival of the rainy season. However, the heroine refuses to accept that the season has truly begun because her lover has not yet returned. She reasons that since her lover is a man of truth who would never break his promise, the forest must be mistaken or lying, rather than her lover being late. The golden blossoms are beautifully compared to golden ornaments worn in the dark hair of women.","model":"gemini-3.5-flash"},"timing":{"male":[[0.0,0.8],[0.8,0.9],[0.9,1.6],[1.6,2.1],[2.1,3.8],[3.8,4.1],[4.1,4.3],[4.3,4.7],[4.7,6.3],[6.34,6.6],[6.6,7.2],[7.2,7.7],[7.7,9.1],[9.1,9.4],[9.4,9.6],[9.6,11.4],[11.4,11.6],[11.6,11.9],[11.9,12.63],[12.63,13.0]],"female":[[0.0,0.9],[0.9,1.0],[1.0,1.6],[1.6,2.1],[2.1,3.8],[3.8,4.1],[4.1,4.4],[4.4,4.7],[4.7,4.99],[4.99,7.0],[7.0,7.5],[7.5,8.0],[8.0,9.6],[9.6,9.9],[9.9,10.1],[10.1,11.9],[11.9,12.1],[12.1,12.5],[12.5,13.03],[13.03,13.5]]},"sync":[[["வண்டுபட","as bees swarm"]],[["ததைந்த","densely blossomed"]],[["கொடியிணர்","clusters on the branches"]],[["இடையிடுபு","appearing at intervals"]],[["பொன்செய்","made of gold"]],[["புனையிழை","crafted jewels"]],[["கட்டிய","worn"]],[["மகளிர்","women"]],[["கதுப்பில்","like the hair"]],[["தோன்றும்","appearing"]],[["புது","fresh"],["பூம்","flowery"]],[["கொன்றை","Cassia"]],[["கானம்","the forest"]],[["காரென","as the rainy season"]],[["கூறினும்","even if it says"]],[["யானோ","As for me"]],[["தேரேன்","I do not believe"]],[["அவர்","he"]],[["பொய்வழங்கலரே","is indeed not one who speaks lies"]],[["பொய்வழங்கலரே","is indeed not one who speaks lies"]]]}